  "Description":          "Basic Environment Description: integrates the Basic Scene Descriptors of the Environment Sensing Technologies and the ego Spatial Attitude into one Basic Environment Descriptors. At Stage 1 there is a single contributor, so integration is degenerate and the fusion outcome is single-EST. It also returns the scene as a prior to each describer; the prior leaves as generic Basic Scene Descriptors, because the describer that consumes it is a technology and must not be made to depend on a CAV Data Type.",

